## The A-R5 patch — PART 1/3 (engine — R24 StringBuilder mutation family + R27 the `CLASS-INFO PROTO FALLBACK LAW`) — base `14c4bf4e` (current `origin/main` S217 HEAD), sha16 `35e0c189b6d21746`

